.TH swarm-daemon-restart 1  "swarm 0.1.0" "Swarmgit manual"
.SH NAME
swarm\-daemon\-restart \- Stop the daemon if it is running, then start it
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBswarm daemon restart\fR [\fB\-\-experimental\-udp\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Stop the daemon if it is running, then start it
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-experimental\-udp\fR
Try direct UDP paths between relayed peers (experimental)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
